  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="888ca6cf-7488-516b-8c3d-be7b6f133c31" activityNameId="5401393c-c3bd-5529-bcde-e23d9da24aa8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ventilation unit 13000 m3/h, w. circuit connected heat exchanger, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ventilation unit 13000 m3/h, w. circuit connected heat exchanger, at plant
Production of a ventilation unit (air handling unit) with 13000 m3/h nominal air flow rate (at 2 m/s air speed in cross section of air filter or heat exchanger), component weight: 2625 kg, total weight: 3017 kg/Unit, including average components for controls, inverter and electric control cabinet, material for 20 filter replacements (once a year for 20 years lifetime). The air handling unit includes a frame construction, two radial belt drive fans, two multi-leaf damper, heat recovery with circuit connected heat exchanger, heating elements, expansion plenum and empty section in supply and extract air. No cooling elements, humidifier, air-mixing plenum and silencer included. The frame construction made of aluminium-profiles, casing made of hot-dip galvanized and powder coated steel sheets insulated with polyurethane foam. Circuit connected heat exchanger for completely separated supply air and exhaust air streams.;
UUID: adf42e1c-7073-3618-b927-ee2aaf7cfeee
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps and for heating the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for infrastructure of the production site included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for ventilation systems in commercial and public buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Process information from 2003 to 2012
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_adf42e1c-7073-3618-b927-ee2aaf7cfeee.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
